  planner_response {
    response: "### HAYAT (\330\255\331\212\330\247\330\251) \342\200\224 Male Reproductive Health Front Door\n**Built for the Future Health Digital Innovation Challenge (Abu Dhabi: Future Health, Microsoft, Inception, MBZUAI)**  \n*Challenge: [Fertility] Male Reproductive Health*\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built\n\nA front-end web application that serves as a private, stigma-free digital front door for male reproductive health:\n\n1. **Global Features & Discrete Protection**\n   - **Quick Hide (Esc Key & Floating Button):** Instant one-click switch to an innocent \"Daily Wellness Journal\" (water, sleep, and activity tracking) with a discreet link to return.\n   - **Full Multilingual & Native RTL:** Complete English, Arabic (`dir=\"rtl\"`), and Hindi (`hi`) dictionaries across all screens, questions, options, tooltips, and clinical badges.\n   - **Cultural Sensitivity:** Neutral phrasing throughout (no assumptions of marital status, religion, or lifestyle; zero stigmatizing words).\n   - **Dual Theme Support:** Dark midnight teal-black palette (`#07131A`, `#2DD4BF`, `#E8D5B5`) with a soft sand light-mode toggle (`#F5EFE6`).\n   - **Safety Footers & Disclaimers:** Visible \"Screening, Not Diagnosis\" disclaimers, human oversight statements, and prototype simulation badges.\n\n2. **Complete 10-Screen Architecture**\n   - **Landing (`/`):** Hero headline, trust pills, \"Why earlier matters\" cards, \"Built around trust\" pillars, and a prominent 3-button demo persona launcher (Low risk, Moderate risk, Urgent red-flag).\n   - **Consent (`/consent`):** Plain-language comparison of what HAYAT does vs. never does, 4 granular toggles (required processing, local storage, anonymised research, clinician summary), and timestamp tracking.\n   - **Assessment Wizard (`/check`):** 6-step questionnaire with dynamic progress bar, expandable \"Why we ask this\" tooltips, non-blocking navigation, BMI calculator, and optional WHO 2021 semen analysis inputs.\n   - **Analysing (`/analysing`):** Safety-first transition pipeline verifying acute red flags first before lifestyle calculations.\n   - **Results (`/results`):** Hero results screen featuring an animated circular risk gauge, horizontal contribution factor bars with simple/detailed toggle, \"Factors working in your favour\", screening vs. diagnosis card, red-flag emergency alert, and a 5-level clinical triage ladder.\n   - **Care Navigator (`/care`):** Step-by-step pathway cards, referral progress tracker (Screened \342\206\222 Booked \342\206\222 Assessed \342\206\222 Follow-up), discreet teleconsultation booking widget with subtle billing tags, and an Abu Dhabi clinic finder with private-entrance and male-clinician filters.\n   - **Privacy Dashboard (`/privacy`):** Live data inventory table, real-time consent toggles, JSON data export, single-click instant data purge modal, and a device activity access log.\n   - **Evidence & Evaluation (`/evidence`):** 500-case deterministic synthetic cohort metrics, count-up KPI cards (91.4% completion, time-to-evaluation compressed from 7.5 to 2.4 months, 100% red-flag recall), Recharts funnel and distribution visualizations, and a demographic fairness audit (&lt;2% max gap across age and language cohorts).\n   - **How It Works & Safety (`/how-it-works`):** 4-step explainer, rule categories breakdown, clinical boundaries policy, and an 8-question FAQ accordion.\n   - **Clinician Summary Modal (Print / Save-as-PDF):** Clean, professional summary formatted specifically for medical consultations.\n\n3. **Transparent Risk Engine (`src/engine/riskEngine.ts`)**\n   - Fully typed, deterministic rule-based engine.\n   - Immediate red-flag prioritization (sudden severe pain, rapid swelling, fever, visible blood in semen, hard lumps) routing directly to urgent assessment.\n   - Weighted lifestyle, metabolic, surgical, and WHO 2021 reference limit evaluations.\n\n4. **Service Layer (`src/services/api.ts`)**\n   - Pluggable mock layer toggled via `VITE_USE_MOCK=true` and `VITE_API_BASE`.\n   - Typed asynchronous functions matching REST API endpoints for seamless backend integration.\n\n---\n\n### Project File Structure\n\n```\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 store/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AppContext.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 engine/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 riskEngine.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 personas.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 syntheticCohort.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 i18n/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 en.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ar.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 hi.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Navbar.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SafetyFooter.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickHideButton.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickHideScreen.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LangSwitcher.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RiskGauge.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 FactorBar.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 TriageLadder.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ClinicianSummaryModal.tsx\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LandingPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ConsentPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WizardPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AnalysingPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ResultsPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CareNavigatorPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PrivacyDashboardPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 EvidencePage.tsx\n        \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 HowItWorksPage.tsx\n```\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Quality Assurance\n\n- **TypeScript & Linting:** 0 type errors, 0 lint warnings (`tsc --noEmit` passed clean).\n- **Compilation:** Production build tested and verified with `compile_applet`.\n- **Responsive Layout:** Optimized for mobile screens (375px+) with accessible tap targets and desktop viewports (1440px+)."
    modified_response: "### HAYAT (\330\255\331\212\330\247\330\251) \342\200\224 Male Reproductive Health Front Door\n**Built for the Future Health Digital Innovation Challenge (Abu Dhabi: Future Health, Microsoft, Inception, MBZUAI)**  \n*Challenge: [Fertility] Male Reproductive Health*\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built\n\nA front-end web application that serves as a private, stigma-free digital front door for male reproductive health:\n\n1. **Global Features & Discrete Protection**\n   - **Quick Hide (Esc Key & Floating Button):** Instant one-click switch to an innocent \"Daily Wellness Journal\" (water, sleep, and activity tracking) with a discreet link to return.\n   - **Full Multilingual & Native RTL:** Complete English, Arabic (`dir=\"rtl\"`), and Hindi (`hi`) dictionaries across all screens, questions, options, tooltips, and clinical badges.\n   - **Cultural Sensitivity:** Neutral phrasing throughout (no assumptions of marital status, religion, or lifestyle; zero stigmatizing words).\n   - **Dual Theme Support:** Dark midnight teal-black palette (`#07131A`, `#2DD4BF`, `#E8D5B5`) with a soft sand light-mode toggle (`#F5EFE6`).\n   - **Safety Footers & Disclaimers:** Visible \"Screening, Not Diagnosis\" disclaimers, human oversight statements, and prototype simulation badges.\n\n2. **Complete 10-Screen Architecture**\n   - **Landing (`/`):** Hero headline, trust pills, \"Why earlier matters\" cards, \"Built around trust\" pillars, and a prominent 3-button demo persona launcher (Low risk, Moderate risk, Urgent red-flag).\n   - **Consent (`/consent`):** Plain-language comparison of what HAYAT does vs. never does, 4 granular toggles (required processing, local storage, anonymised research, clinician summary), and timestamp tracking.\n   - **Assessment Wizard (`/check`):** 6-step questionnaire with dynamic progress bar, expandable \"Why we ask this\" tooltips, non-blocking navigation, BMI calculator, and optional WHO 2021 semen analysis inputs.\n   - **Analysing (`/analysing`):** Safety-first transition pipeline verifying acute red flags first before lifestyle calculations.\n   - **Results (`/results`):** Hero results screen featuring an animated circular risk gauge, horizontal contribution factor bars with simple/detailed toggle, \"Factors working in your favour\", screening vs. diagnosis card, red-flag emergency alert, and a 5-level clinical triage ladder.\n   - **Care Navigator (`/care`):** Step-by-step pathway cards, referral progress tracker (Screened \342\206\222 Booked \342\206\222 Assessed \342\206\222 Follow-up), discreet teleconsultation booking widget with subtle billing tags, and an Abu Dhabi clinic finder with private-entrance and male-clinician filters.\n   - **Privacy Dashboard (`/privacy`):** Live data inventory table, real-time consent toggles, JSON data export, single-click instant data purge modal, and a device activity access log.\n   - **Evidence & Evaluation (`/evidence`):** 500-case deterministic synthetic cohort metrics, count-up KPI cards (91.4% completion, time-to-evaluation compressed from 7.5 to 2.4 months, 100% red-flag recall), Recharts funnel and distribution visualizations, and a demographic fairness audit (&lt;2% max gap across age and language cohorts).\n   - **How It Works & Safety (`/how-it-works`):** 4-step explainer, rule categories breakdown, clinical boundaries policy, and an 8-question FAQ accordion.\n   - **Clinician Summary Modal (Print / Save-as-PDF):** Clean, professional summary formatted specifically for medical consultations.\n\n3. **Transparent Risk Engine (`src/engine/riskEngine.ts`)**\n   - Fully typed, deterministic rule-based engine.\n   - Immediate red-flag prioritization (sudden severe pain, rapid swelling, fever, visible blood in semen, hard lumps) routing directly to urgent assessment.\n   - Weighted lifestyle, metabolic, surgical, and WHO 2021 reference limit evaluations.\n\n4. **Service Layer (`src/services/api.ts`)**\n   - Pluggable mock layer toggled via `VITE_USE_MOCK=true` and `VITE_API_BASE`.\n   - Typed asynchronous functions matching REST API endpoints for seamless backend integration.\n\n---\n\n### Project File Structure\n\n```\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 store/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AppContext.tsx\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 engine/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 riskEngine.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 personas.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 syntheticCohort.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 i18n/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 en.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ar.ts\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 hi.ts\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Navbar.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SafetyFooter.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickHideButton.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickHideScreen.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LangSwitcher.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RiskGauge.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 FactorBar.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 TriageLadder.tsx\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ClinicianSummaryModal.tsx\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LandingPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ConsentPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WizardPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AnalysingPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ResultsPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CareNavigatorPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PrivacyDashboardPage.tsx\n        \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 EvidencePage.tsx\n        \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 HowItWorksPage.tsx\n```\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Quality Assurance\n\n- **TypeScript & Linting:** 0 type errors, 0 lint warnings (`tsc --noEmit` passed clean).\n- **Compilation:** Production build tested and verified with `compile_applet`.\n- **Responsive Layout:** Optimized for mobile screens (375px+) with accessible tap targets and desktop viewports (1440px+)."
