  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nUpgrade the existing **HAYAT** male reproductive health web app so the entire site feels **cinematic, alive, calm, trustworthy, and safe** for a sensitive health context\342\200\224while preserving all risk engine rules (`src/engine/riskEngine.ts`), service layer (`src/services/api.ts`), i18n keys (`src/i18n/*`), and consent/safety logic.\n\nCore requirements & non-negotiables:\n- **Motion Principles**:\n  - Calm & confident: durations `300\342\200\223700ms`, easing `cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)` (`[0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]`), no bounce, no flashing > 3 flashes/sec.\n  - Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` everywhere (simple fades; disable smooth scroll, parallax, particles, cursor effects, GSAP pinning).\n  - **Safety Exceptions**:\n    1. Red-flag urgent card on Results appears **INSTANTLY** with no reveal delay or scroll-gating.\n    2. **Quick Hide** (button, `Esc`, logo double-tap) switches **INSTANTLY** with no transition.\n  - **Performance**: Only **ONE WebGL context** in the whole app (Hero only), lazy-load heavy chunks, pause off-screen (`IntersectionObserver`) & when `document.hidden`, cap `devicePixelRatio` at `1.5`, lighter variants on touch/mobile (fewer particles, no custom cursor, no Lenis smooth scroll).\n- **Animation System**:\n  - Use `gsap` (+ `ScrollTrigger`), `lenis` (desktop only, disabled on touch & reduced motion), `motion/react` (Framer Motion v12), `@react-three/fiber` + `three` (Hero only).\n  - Reusable toolkit in `src/motion/` (already created!).\n  - Desktop-only soft warm cursor glow (`CursorGlow`).\n  - Subtle site-wide Canvas2D ambient dotted wave background (`AmbientWaveBackground`) that shifts tint calmly by route and tints toward the active RiskBand on `/results` without reducing text contrast.\n  - Calm full-page route transitions (`AnimatePresence`, `< 600ms`, skipped for reduced motion, resets scroll to top & syncs Lenis).\n- **Page-by-Page Deliverables**:\n  - **Landing**: Keep current hero + WebGL dotted wave (~6,000 pts desktop, lighter ~2,200 on mobile, off-screen/hidden pause, static SVG fallback), `<SplitText>` line/word headline reveal, staggered trust pills, `<Magnetic>` CTAs; below hero: **GSAP ScrollTrigger PINNED 4-beat scroll story** (`(1) Today: men often enter the fertility pathway late`, `(2) long delay timeline filling slowly (~7.5 mo illustrative / simulated)`, `(3) With a private first step, timeline compresses (~2.4 mo illustrative / simulated)`, `(4) CTA \"Start my private check\"`); `\"Why earlier matters\"` & `\"Built around trust\"` use `<Reveal>` + `<TiltCard>`; demo persona cards have hover lift + click micro-animation.\n  - **Consent**: Animated SVG explainer (device + shield + `<PathDraw>` arrows showing answers stay on device), smooth animated toggle switches with animated confirmation ticks, animated disabled\342\206\222enabled transition on `\"I understand, continue\"`.\n  - **Wizard**: One-question-per-screen; directional slide/fade mirrored for RTL Arabic (forward slides left LTR / right RTL; back slides right LTR / left RTL); selection animation (accent border, soft fill, animated drawn SVG checkmark); smooth wave-shaped progress bar (mirrored in RTL); keyboard hint bar; **CRITICAL FIX**: disable `1\342\200\2239` and `Enter` shortcuts while ANY `INPUT`, `TEXTAREA`, `SELECT`, or `contentEditable` (including height/weight inputs, semen inputs, and range sliders!) is focused.\n  - **Analysing**: Signature sequence where scattered dots converge into a ring forming the result gauge outline while the 3 status lines cross-fade; **\342\211\244 2.5s total**; skippable via visible `\"Skip\"` button; simple fade for reduced motion.\n  - **Results (scroll story)**: Order: (1) instant red-flag urgent card if applicable, (2) `\"screening, not a diagnosis\"` banner, (3) animated `0 \342\206\222 score` gauge morph + summary, (4) `\"Why this result?\"` staggered factor bars with direction icons & `\"You can change this\"` tags, (5) `TriageLadder` with vertical `<PathDraw>` connector line & softly pulsing `\"You are here\"` marker, (6) action plan + doctor questions, (7) buttons + interactive **What-If Panel** (`WhatIfPanel`, live `assessRisk()`, `\"Illustration only, not medical advice.\"`); subtle band tint on page/ambient wave.\n  - **Care Navigator**: Animated 4-step stepper (`Screened \342\206\222 Booked \342\206\222 Assessed \342\206\222 Follow-up`) with animated progress line (RTL-aware); clinics wrapped in `<Reveal>` + `<TiltCard>`, ALL labeled `\"Sample data\"` and distances labeled `\"illustrative\"` (e.g. `3.2 km away (illustrative)`); teleconsult clearly marked as mock/demo booking with NO personal fields (no name/phone/email).\n  - **Privacy Dashboard**: Animated `\"What left your device\"` SVG data-flow diagram (`\"Nothing\"` + checkmark by default; updates dynamically if optional `shareAnonymisedResearch` toggle is on); **Delete everything** plays a calm particle `\"dissolve\"` animation breaking rows into fading sand/taupe particles before showing success state; **Export (JSON)** shows notice modal `\"This file contains sensitive health information. Store it carefully.\"` before download AND prepends `_notice: \"This file contains sensitive health information. Store it carefully.\"` at the top of the JSON file.\n  - **Evidence**: KPI cards use `<CountUp>` on scroll into view; Recharts animate on enter with direct labels & readable axes; fairness section shows group bars + `\"Max parity gap\"` indicator + green tick when `< 5` percentage points; `\"Simulated evaluation, not real patients\"` & `\"Method and limits\"` explaining simulated rule behavior does not evaluate/claim real-world clinical accuracy; **remove any wording like `\"validation\"`, `\"proof\"`, `\"proven\"`, `\"proves\"`, or `\"accuracy proven\"` anywhere in the app**.\n  - **How It Works**: **Pinned 4-step animated explainer** (`Private intake \342\206\222 Rule-based engine \342\206\222 Explainable guidance \342\206\222 Targeted triage`) highlighting each step on scroll (with custom animated SVG mini-diagram per step), compact `\"Safety and limits\"` section, smooth-height FAQ accordion.\n  - **Quick Hide**: Instant switch (no transition).\n  - **Polish**: Consistent 8px spacing scale, card radius (`22px`), button hover/press/focus states, custom skeleton/shimmer loading fallback, empty states, tidy **404 route (`NotFoundPage`)**, updated `<title>`, `<meta name=\"description\">`, favicon, OG image, RTL Arabic & Hindi support (including RTL-mirrored animations).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n- **Skills & References Read**:\n  - Read `/skills/system_skills/applet_seo/SKILL.md`\n  - Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` and `references/2_landing_marketing.md`\n  - Read `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md` and `references/fundamentals.md`\n- **Packages Installed**:\n  - Installed `gsap` and `lenis` in `/package.json` via `install_applet_package`. Existing `motion` (`^12.23.24`), `@react-three/fiber` (`^9.8.2`), `three` (`^0.187.0`), `recharts` (`^3.10.1`), `react-router-dom` (`^7.18.5`) are all installed.\n- **Motion Toolkit Created in `/src/motion/`**:\n  - `/src/motion/usePrefersReducedMotion.ts` (`usePrefersReducedMotion`, `useIsTouchDevice`)\n  - `/src/motion/config.ts` (`EASE_CALM`, `CSS_EASE_CALM`, `GSAP_EASE_CALM`, `DURATIONS`)\n  - `/src/motion/Reveal.tsx` (`<Reveal>`)\n  - `/src/motion/SplitText.tsx` (`<SplitText>` with `sr-only` accessible text)\n  - `/src/motion/CountUp.tsx` (`<CountUp>`)\n  - `/src/motion/Magnetic.tsx` (`<Magnetic>` desktop-only)\n  - `/src/motion/TiltCard.tsx` (`<TiltCard>` desktop-only)\n  - `/src/motion/PathDraw.tsx` (`<PathDraw>`)\n  - `/src/motion/index.ts` (barrel exports)\n- **SEO, Favicon & OG Share Image Completed**:\n  - Generated warm sand & teal OG share banner via `generate_image` (`/src/assets/images/hayat_og_share_1794806522073.jpg`) and copied to `/public/og-image.jpg`.\n  - Created `/public/favicon.svg`.\n  - Updated `/index.html` with `<title>`, `<meta name=\"description\">`, favicon, `og:image`, `twitter:image`, and Schema.org JSON-LD.\n\n### Inspected / Pending Implementation:\n- Inspected `/vite.config.ts`, `/package.json`, `/metadata.json`, `/src/data/syntheticCohort.ts`, and ran `grep` for prohibited claim words (`validat|proof|proven|accuracy`) across `src/` \342\200\224 found `\"validation\"` in `src/pages/EvidencePage.tsx` line 337 and `\"prove real-world clinical accuracy\"` on line 324 (must be softened/removed).\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- `motion` v12 (`import { ... } from \'motion/react\'`) is installed (same API as Framer Motion); use `motion/react` consistently.\n- `@react-three/drei` was NOT installed intentionally to avoid React 19 peer dependency conflicts; `HeroDottedWave.tsx` already uses `@react-three/fiber` + `three` `<points>` cleanly.\n- Currently installed `vite.config.ts` serves `/public/*` at root, so `/favicon.svg` and `/og-image.jpg` resolve cleanly.\n- Existing `src/components/HeroDottedWave.tsx` needs performance enhancements per new prompt: fewer particles on touch/mobile (~2,200 vs 6,000 desktop), `IntersectionObserver` off-screen pause (provided via prop from `HeroWaveWrapper.tsx`), and full stop under reduced motion.\n- In `WizardPage.tsx`, `input type=\"range\"` sliders were NOT excluded from `1\342\200\2239` / `Enter` shortcuts before (`isTextOrNumberInput` skipped `range`!). The prompt explicitly requires: *\"number-key and Enter shortcuts MUST be disabled while any text/number input, slider or textarea is focused\"*. Exclude ALL `INPUT`, `TEXTAREA`, `SELECT`, and `isContentEditable` elements!\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- No build/runtime errors encountered yet in this pass. `gsap` and `lenis` installed cleanly.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Theme default is Warm Sand Light (`:root` in `src/index.css`) with `.theme-dark` Warm Charcoal toggle (`src/store/AppContext.tsx`).\n- `document.documentElement.dir` toggles `\'rtl\'` for Arabic (`ar`) and `\'ltr\'` for `en` / `hi`.\n- All components/pages already use CSS variables (`--bg-deep`, `--surface`, `--card`, `--text-main`, `--text-muted`, `--brand`, `--accent`, `--accent-text`, `--risk-low/mod/elev/urg`, `--border-hairline`).\n- Remember to inspect `/src/index.css` if adding shimmer/skeleton keyframes or subtle pulse CSS (`@keyframes` respecting `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` and < 3Hz).\n\n## 6. Next Steps\nImplement in clean parallel batches, then compile, lint, and thoroughly test:\n\n1. **Global Visuals, CSS, Hero & Motion Infrastructure**:\n   - Update `/src/index.css`: add `.skeleton-shimmer` utility (disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`) and consistent subtle button press (`active:scale-[0.98]`) / focus styles.\n   - Update `/src/components/HeroDottedWave.tsx` and `/src/components/HeroWaveWrapper.tsx`: pass `isVisible` via `IntersectionObserver` (pause loop when scrolled off-screen), `isTouch` lighter point grid (`~2,200` points vs `6,000` desktop), DPR capped at `1.5`, tab `visibilitychange` pause, software WebGL awareness.\n   - Create `/src/components/AmbientWaveBackground.tsx`: low-contrast Canvas2D dotted wave background (`opacity ~0.16`, fewer dots on mobile, paused on hidden tab, static/hidden on `prefers-reduced-motion`), shifts hue smoothly with `location.pathname` and tints subtly toward `result.band` color on `/results`.\n   - Create `/src/components/CursorGlow.tsx`: desktop-only (`!isTouch && !reduced`) low-contrast warm halo following cursor via `requestAnimationFrame`.\n   - Create `/src/pages/NotFoundPage.tsx`: tidy 404 route with `\"Return to HAYAT\"` CTA.\n\n2. **App Shell, Route Transitions & Lenis Smooth Scroll (`/src/App.tsx`)**:\n   - Integrate `Lenis` smooth scroll in `AppLayout` ONLY when `!isTouch && !reduced && !isQuickHideActive` (destroy cleanly on change/unmount, reset scroll on route change via `window.scrollTo(0, 0)` + `lenis.scrollTo(0, { immediate: true })`).\n   - Add calm `AnimatePresence mode=\"wait\"` route transition (`opacity` + tiny `y` / sweeping wave accent mask `< 450ms`, instant/skipped for reduced motion & NOT wrapping `isQuickHideActive` which switches instantly).\n   - Mount `<AmbientWaveBackground />`, `<CursorGlow />`, skeleton `<PageFallback />`, and `<Route path=\"*\" element={<NotFoundPage />} />`.\n   - Ensure consistent button hover/press (`active:scale-[0.985]`) across `Navbar`, `QuickHideButton`, `LangSwitcher`.\n\n3. **Upgrade Every Page & Component**:\n   - `/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`: Hero with `<SplitText>` headline (`\"private first step\"` in Fraunces italic), staggered trust pills, `<Magnetic>` primary CTA, `HeroWaveWrapper`; add **GSAP + ScrollTrigger pinned 4-beat scroll story** (`\"Today: men often enter the fertility pathway late\"` \342\206\222 `\"long delay timeline (~7.5 mo illustrative / simulated)\"` \342\206\222 `\"With a private first step, timeline compresses (~2.4 mo illustrative / simulated)\"` \342\206\222 `\"Start my private check\"` CTA), skipped/stacked cleanly for `prefers-reduced-motion` and touch/small screens if needed (or responsive GSAP `matchMedia` / clean ScrollTrigger cleanup via `gsap.context()`); `<Reveal>` + `<TiltCard>` on Why Earlier & Built Around Trust cards; hover lift + click micro-animation on Demo Persona buttons.\n   - `/src/pages/ConsentPage.tsx`: Add animated SVG device+shield explainer with `<PathDraw>` arrows keeping answers inside the device; upgrade checkboxes to smooth animated switches (`role=\"switch\"`) with animated checkmark draw; animate Continue button enabled state transition.\n   - `/src/pages/WizardPage.tsx`: Mirror slide direction & progress wave cleanly in RTL (`document.documentElement.dir === \'rtl\'` or `language === \'ar\'`); animated SVG checkmark draw + soft selection fill on cards; **fix keyboard listener** to ignore `1\342\200\2239` and `Enter` whenever `INPUT`, `TEXTAREA`, `SELECT`, or `contentEditable` is focused; keep keyboard hint bar.\n   - `/src/pages/AnalysingPage.tsx`: Signature Canvas2D (or SVG) dot-convergence-into-ring-gauge sequence (`max 2.3s`), cross-fading the 3 status messages, `\"Skip\"` link/button navigating immediately to `/results`, simple fade on `prefers-reduced-motion`.\n   - `/src/components/TriageLadder.tsx` & `/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx`:\n     - Ensure Urgent red-flag card in `ResultsPage.tsx` has ZERO reveal animation/delay (`immediate` / no `initial` hidden state!).\n     - Ensure `TriageLadder.tsx` draws a continuous vertical `<PathDraw>` SVG line down the left/start side with a softly pulsing `\"You are here\"` marker (`< 3Hz`, static under reduced motion).\n     - Subtle RiskBand accent tint on `ResultsPage` header/surface.\n     - Verify `WhatIfPanel.tsx` works cleanly with `\"Illustration only, not medical advice.\"`\n   - `/src/pages/CareNavigatorPage.tsx`: Animated 4-step horizontal/vertical progress line filling as steps are marked done (RTL-aware); wrap clinic cards in `<Reveal>` + `<TiltCard>`; ensure EVERY clinic card displays `\"Sample data\"` and distances explicitly say `(illustrative)` (e.g. `3.2 km away (illustrative)`); mark teleconsultation explicitly `\"Mock / demo booking \342\200\224 no personal details required\"`.\n   - `/src/pages/PrivacyDashboardPage.tsx`:\n     - Add animated SVG `\"What left your device\"` diagram (default `\"Nothing\"` + checkmark; updates if `consent.shareAnonymisedResearch` is enabled).\n     - Add calm particle `\"dissolve\"` animation when clicking `\"Erase Everything Now\"` (animates inventory rows breaking into drifting sand/taupe particles on Canvas2D/motion before clearing state and showing success state).\n     - Export JSON: show a notice modal/banner `\"This file contains sensitive health information. Store it carefully.\"` before triggering download, AND prepend `_notice: \"This file contains sensitive health information. Store it carefully.\"` as the first key of the exported JSON.\n   - `/src/pages/EvidencePage.tsx`:\n     - Use `<CountUp>` on the KPI numbers when scrolled into view.\n     - Keep simulated disclosure `\"Simulated evaluation, not real patients\"`.\n     - Remove `\"validation\"`, `\"prove\"`, `\"proof\"`, `\"accuracy\"` claims in text/labels (change `\"Rule Consistency\"` in `EvidencePage` & `\"do not assess or claim real-world clinical accuracy, diagnostic performance, or patient outcomes. Prospective clinical evaluation with real patients...\"`). Also verify across all of `src/` via `grep` that zero occurrences of `\"validation\"`, `\"proof\"`, `\"proven\"`, or `\"accuracy proven\"` remain.\n   - `/src/pages/HowItWorksPage.tsx`:\n     - Build **GSAP ScrollTrigger pinned 4-step explainer** (`01 Private intake` \342\206\222 `02 Rule-based engine` \342\206\222 `03 Explainable guidance` \342\206\222 `04 Targeted triage`), highlighting active step as user scrolls, paired with a small animated SVG diagram per step (falls back to clean sticky/stacked cards for reduced motion).\n     - Compact `\"Safety and limits\"` section + smooth height-animated FAQ accordion (`AnimatePresence` / `motion.div`).\n\n4. **Verification**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`).\n   - Grep check across `src/` for prohibited claim terms (`validation`, `proof`, `proven`, `accuracy proven`), verify RTL/Hindi/English i18n keys untouched, verify `riskEngine.ts` & `services/api.ts` untouched.\n   - Restart dev server (`restart_dev_server`) and run comprehensive `tsx` verification tests + HTTP route/asset checks (`favicon.svg`, `og-image.jpg`, `dist/` chunks).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Do NOT ask the user any questions; complete all remaining implementation and verification autonomously.\n- Do NOT alter `src/engine/riskEngine.ts`, `src/services/api.ts`, `src/i18n/*`, or safety/consent logic.\n- Safety exceptions: Urgent red-flag card & Quick Hide MUST be instant (zero animation delay).\n- Never use `\"validation\"`, `\"proof\"`, `\"proven\"`, or `\"accuracy proven\"` in visible copy.\n- Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` on final build check.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 178
