  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering API Interactions**\n\nI\'ve realized that I need to avoid modifying `src/services/api.ts` based on the instructions. This has led me to rethink how the PrivacyDashboardPage exports JSON. My current plan is to call `exportData(answers, result, consent)` and then parse and build after the prepending of `_notice` when the page exports JSON.\n\n\n**Implementing Global Visuals**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation phase for the global visuals. I\'m focusing on `/src/index.css` to add the required styling. The `HeroDottedWave.tsx` component is next, accepting props to optimize the visual based on visibility and touch interactions. Then, `HeroWaveWrapper.tsx` will track visibility and preferences, and finally, I plan to implement the subtle site-wide dotted wave background in `AmbientWaveBackground.tsx`.\n\n\n"
