  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining RTL Handling**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing RTL (Right-to-Left) language support in the WizardPage component. Specifically, I\'m adjusting the slide and fade animations to mirror the directionality in Arabic. This involves tweaking the x-axis translations based on the `isRtl` flag, ensuring a visually intuitive experience for RTL users.\n\n\n**Implementing Keyboard Shortcut Fixes**\n\nI\'ve just implemented a crucial keyboard shortcut fix, disabling number shortcuts (1-9) and Enter keys when any input field, textarea, select element, or contentEditable element has focus. This prevents accidental navigation or form submission while typing in those elements. This change ensures a cleaner and more intuitive user experience, even for inputs like weight, height, or any other numeric input. Also, Enter is now ignored when the focused target is a button or link.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Page Flow**\n\nI\'m now focusing on optimizing the visual hierarchy and loading order within the `ResultsPage.tsx` component. The critical update involves a safety exception, where an urgent red-flag card renders instantly, bypassing all animations. Following this, I\'m working on subtle visual cues like RiskBand tints and verifying the correct rendering sequence of the remaining content, specifically the `RiskGauge`, factors, triage ladder, and action items.\n\n\n**Reordering Result Sections**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the reorganization of sections within `ResultsPage.tsx`, specifically reordering the content to match the intended logical flow. The critical change involves moving the `WhatIfPanel`, which was previously before the `TriageLadder`, and placing it after the Action Plan and Doctor Questions sections. This new order ensures a more intuitive progression: urgent flag, \"screening\" banner, score gauge, factor bars, `TriageLadder`, action items, and finally, interactive elements.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11269310997699788649"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Fix WizardPage keyboard shortcuts while any INPUT/TEXTAREA/SELECT/range slider is focused, mirror animations & progress wave for RTL, and add animated SVG checkmark draw on selected options\", \"Instruction\":\"Update WizardPage.tsx for RTL-mirrored transitions, SVG checkmark path draw, and full input keyboard guard\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":62, \"ReplacementContent\":\"export const WizardPage: React.FC = () => {\\n  const { t, answers, setAnswer, consent, language } = useApp();\\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\\n  const shouldReduceMotion = useReducedMotion();\\n  const isRtl = language === \'ar\';\\n\\n  const [currentIdx, setCurrentIdx] = useState(0);\\n  const [direction, setDirection] = useState<1 | -1>(1);\\n  const [whyOpen, setWhyOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const autoAdvanceTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\", \"StartLine\":52, \"TargetContent\":\"export const WizardPage: React.FC = () => {\\n  const { t, answers, setAnswer, consent } = useApp();\\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\\n  const shouldReduceMotion = useReducedMotion();\\n\\n  const [currentIdx, setCurrentIdx] = useState(0);\\n  const [direction, setDirection] = useState<1 | -1>(1);\\n  const [whyOpen, setWhyOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const autoAdvanceTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":625, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Keyboard shortcuts: 1-9 selects options, Enter advances (disabled when ANY input, slider, select, or textarea is focused)\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      const target = e.target as HTMLElement | null;\\n      const tag = target?.tagName;\\n      const isFormControlFocused =\\n        tag === \'INPUT\' ||\\n        tag === \'TEXTAREA\' ||\\n        tag === \'SELECT\' ||\\n        !!target?.isContentEditable;\\n\\n      if (isFormControlFocused) return;\\n\\n      if (e.key >= \'1\' && e.key <= \'9\' && !e.metaKey && !e.ctrlKey && !e.altKey) {\\n        const optionIdx = parseInt(e.key, 10) - 1;\\n        if (currentQ.options && optionIdx < currentQ.options.length) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          const chosen = currentQ.options[optionIdx];\\n          if (currentQ.type === \'single\') {\\n            handleSingleSelect(currentQ, chosen.id);\\n          } else if (currentQ.type === \'multi\' && currentQ.field) {\\n            toggleMultiSelect(currentQ.field as any, chosen.id);\\n          }\\n        }\\n      } else if (e.key === \'Enter\' && tag !== \'BUTTON\' && tag !== \'A\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        handleNext();\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n  });\", \"StartLine\":596, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Keyboard shortcuts: 1-9 selects options, Enter advances (Esc is handled globally for Quick Hide)\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const onKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      const target = e.target as HTMLElement | null;\\n      const isTextOrNumberInput =\\n        target?.tagName === \'INPUT\' &&\\n        (target as HTMLInputElement).type !== \'range\' &&\\n        (target as HTMLInputElement).type !== \'checkbox\';\\n\\n      if (e.key >= \'1\' && e.key <= \'9\' && !isTextOrNumberInput && !e.metaKey && !e.ctrlKey && !e.altKey) {\\n        const optionIdx = parseInt(e.key, 10) - 1;\\n        if (currentQ.options && optionIdx < currentQ.options.length) {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          const chosen = currentQ.options[optionIdx];\\n          if (currentQ.type === \'single\') {\\n            handleSingleSelect(currentQ, chosen.id);\\n          } else if (currentQ.type === \'multi\' && currentQ.field) {\\n            toggleMultiSelect(currentQ.field as any, chosen.id);\\n          }\\n        }\\n      } else if (e.key === \'Enter\' && target?.tagName !== \'BUTTON\' && target?.tagName !== \'A\') {\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        handleNext();\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', onKeyDown);\\n  });\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":708, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        {/* SVG Wave Progress Bar (mirrored cleanly in RTL) */}\\n        <div\\n          className=\\\"relative w-full h-5 flex items-center overflow-hidden\\\"\\n          role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n          aria-valuenow={safeIdx + 1}\\n          aria-valuemin={1}\\n          aria-valuemax={questions.length}\\n          aria-label={`Question ${safeIdx + 1} of ${questions.length}`}\\n        >\\n          <svg\\n            viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 18\\\"\\n            preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\"\\n            className={`w-full h-4 overflow-visible ${isRtl ? \'-scale-x-100\' : \'\'}`}\\n          >\\n            <defs>\\n              <clipPath id=\\\"hayat-wave-clip\\\">\\n                <rect\\n                  x=\\\"0\\\"\\n                  y=\\\"0\\\"\\n                  width={Math.max(12, progressRatio * 600)}\\n                  height=\\\"18\\\"\\n                  style={{\\n                    transition: shouldReduceMotion\\n                      ? \'none\'\\n                      : \'width 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)\',\\n                  }}\\n                />\\n              </clipPath>\\n            </defs>\\n            {/* Track wave */}\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M0 9 Q 25 3, 50 9 T 100 9 T 150 9 T 200 9 T 250 9 T 300 9 T 350 9 T 400 9 T 450 9 T 500 9 T 550 9 T 600 9\\\"\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke=\\\"var(--gauge-track)\\\"\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"3\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n            />\\n            {/* Filled wave */}\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M0 9 Q 25 3, 50 9 T 100 9 T 150 9 T 200 9 T 250 9 T 300 9 T 350 9 T 400 9 T 450 9 T 500 9 T 550 9 T 600 9\\\"\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke=\\\"var(--accent)\\\"\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"3.5\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              clipPath=\\\"url(#hayat-wave-clip)\\\"\\n            />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Single-Question Paper Card (mirrored slide direction in RTL) */}\\n      <AnimatePresence mode=\\\"wait\\\" initial={false}>\\n        <motion.div\\n          key={currentQ.id}\\n          initial={\\n            shouldReduceMotion\\n              ? false\\n              : { opacity: 0, x: direction * (isRtl ? -26 : 26) }\\n          }\\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n          exit={\\n            shouldReduceMotion\\n              ? { opacity: 0 }\\n              : { opacity: 0, x: direction * (isRtl ? 26 : -26) }\\n          }\\n          transition={\\n            shouldReduceMotion\\n              ? { duration: 0 }\\n              : { duration: 0.3, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }\\n          }\\n          className=\\\"paper-card p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6\\\"\\n        >\", \"StartLine\":656, \"TargetContent\":\"        {/* SVG Wave Progress Bar */}\\n        <div\\n          className=\\\"relative w-full h-5 flex items-center overflow-hidden\\\"\\n          role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n          aria-valuenow={safeIdx + 1}\\n          aria-valuemin={1}\\n          aria-valuemax={questions.length}\\n          aria-label={`Question ${safeIdx + 1} of ${questions.length}`}\\n        >\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 18\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" className=\\\"w-full h-4 overflow-visible\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <clipPath id=\\\"hayat-wave-clip\\\">\\n                <rect\\n                  x=\\\"0\\\"\\n                  y=\\\"0\\\"\\n                  width={Math.max(12, progressRatio * 600)}\\n                  height=\\\"18\\\"\\n                  style={{ transition: shouldReduceMotion ? \'none\' : \'width 0.35s ease-out\' }}\\n                />\\n              </clipPath>\\n            </defs>\\n            {/* Track wave */}\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M0 9 Q 25 3, 50 9 T 100 9 T 150 9 T 200 9 T 250 9 T 300 9 T 350 9 T 400 9 T 450 9 T 500 9 T 550 9 T 600 9\\\"\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke=\\\"var(--gauge-track)\\\"\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"3\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n            />\\n            {/* Filled wave */}\\n            <path\\n              d=\\\"M0 9 Q 25 3, 50 9 T 100 9 T 150 9 T 200 9 T 250 9 T 300 9 T 350 9 T 400 9 T 450 9 T 500 9 T 550 9 T 600 9\\\"\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke=\\\"var(--accent)\\\"\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"3.5\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              clipPath=\\\"url(#hayat-wave-clip)\\\"\\n            />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Main Single-Question Paper Card */}\\n      <AnimatePresence mode=\\\"wait\\\" initial={false}>\\n        <motion.div\\n          key={currentQ.id}\\n          initial={shouldReduceMotion ? false : { opacity: 0, x: direction * 24 }}\\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}\\n          exit={shouldReduceMotion ? { opacity: 0 } : { opacity: 0, x: direction * -24 }}\\n          transition={shouldReduceMotion ? { duration: 0 } : { duration: 0.22, ease: \'easeOut\' }}\\n          className=\\\"paper-card p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6\\\"\\n        >\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":785, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                    {selected && (\\n                      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--accent-text)] shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                        <motion.path\\n                          d=\\\"M 4 10.5 L 8.2 14.5 L 16 6\\\"\\n                          fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                          stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n                          strokeWidth={2.4}\\n                          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                          strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n                          initial={shouldReduceMotion ? { pathLength: 1 } : { pathLength: 0 }}\\n                          animate={{ pathLength: 1 }}\\n                          transition={\\n                            shouldReduceMotion\\n                              ? { duration: 0 }\\n                              : { duration: 0.25, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }\\n                          }\\n                        />\\n                      </svg>\\n                    )}\\n                  </button>\", \"StartLine\":781, \"TargetContent\":\"                    {selected && <Check className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--accent-text)] shrink-0\\\" />}\\n                  </button>\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":841, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                    {selected && (\\n                      <svg\\n                        viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"w-5 h-5 shrink-0\\\"\\n                        style={{ color: urgentChoice ? \'var(--risk-urg)\' : \'var(--accent-text)\' }}\\n                        aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <motion.path\\n                          d=\\\"M 4 10.5 L 8.2 14.5 L 16 6\\\"\\n                          fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                          stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n                          strokeWidth={2.4}\\n                          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                          strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n                          initial={shouldReduceMotion ? { pathLength: 1 } : { pathLength: 0 }}\\n                          animate={{ pathLength: 1 }}\\n                          transition={\\n                            shouldReduceMotion\\n                              ? { duration: 0 }\\n                              : { duration: 0.25, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }\\n                          }\\n                        />\\n                      </svg>\\n                    )}\\n                  </button>\", \"StartLine\":832, \"TargetContent\":\"                    {selected && (\\n                      <Check\\n                        className=\\\"w-5 h-5 shrink-0\\\"\\n                        style={{ color: urgentChoice ? \'var(--risk-urg)\' : \'var(--accent-text)\' }}\\n                      />\\n                    )}\\n                  </button>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/WizardPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating WizardPage animations and keyboard guards\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update WizardPage.tsx\"}"
