  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Care Navigator**\n\nI\'ve been working on `/src/pages/CareNavigatorPage.tsx`. My current focus is implementing an animated 4-step stepper (Screened, Booked, Assessed, Follow-up). I\'m also including an animated horizontal progress line, which will work seamlessly in right-to-left layouts.\n\n\n**Designing Clinic Cards**\n\nI\'m now implementing the clinic card design. I\'m focusing on ensuring each card is wrapped in both a `<Reveal>` and `<TiltCard>` component. I\'m prioritizing the display of a \"Sample data\" badge on every card. I\'ll also explicitly label distances and wait times as \"illustrative\". Also, I must ensure teleconsultation options are clearly marked as a mock demo.\n\n\n**Implementing Export Logic**\n\nI\'ve just added the export functionality. I\'ve designed a clean notice modal that appears upon clicking \"Export.\" It provides a clear warning about sensitive data, with \"Cancel\" and \"Download JSON\" buttons. Upon confirmation, I build a JSON object including the sensitive data notice and trigger the download.\n\n\n\n**Refining Explanation Page**\n\nI\'m now overhauling the \"How It Works\" page. I\'m focusing on a GSAP + ScrollTrigger-powered, 4-step explainer with animated SVG diagrams for each step. There\'s also a static alternative for users with reduced motion preferences. I\'ve also incorporated a \"Safety and limits\" section and a \"Cultural Respect & Non-Stigmatising Design\" component. I\'m also including a height-animated FAQ accordion.\n\n\n"
    provider_assigned_message_id: "H5T6asieIbOUmtkPwYa5yAk"
  }
}
